WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:08.174
[opening theme music playing]

00:35.035 --> 00:37.037
- [rain splattering]
- [suspenseful music playing]

00:38.705 --> 00:40.165
[growling]

00:41.666 --> 00:43.418
[thunder rumbles]

00:44.044 --> 00:46.171
[dog barking]

00:51.509 --> 00:52.677
That's the alchemy of souls?

00:53.303 --> 00:54.637
[thunder rumbles]

00:58.183 --> 01:00.143
[intense music playing]

01:07.525 --> 01:11.071
[Jang Uk]
Is my soul being shifted right now?

01:15.784 --> 01:18.119
[intense music continues playing]

01:49.442 --> 01:51.402
[soft music playing]

02:39.033 --> 02:39.868
[gasps]

02:46.875 --> 02:47.709
[grunts]

02:49.085 --> 02:49.919
[exhales deeply]

02:59.929 --> 03:01.347
I'm in my body.

03:02.891 --> 03:04.017
What just happened?

03:08.229 --> 03:09.147
[Mu-deok gasps]

03:12.025 --> 03:13.067
Jang Uk.

03:14.110 --> 03:14.986
Jang Uk.

03:18.448 --> 03:19.407
Jang Uk.

03:20.867 --> 03:21.784
Jang Uk.

03:31.461 --> 03:33.463
[suspenseful music playing]

03:37.175 --> 03:40.803
Gil-ju, you bastard!
You managed to steal his body after all.

03:42.639 --> 03:43.473
Mu-deok.

03:44.390 --> 03:45.225
[Jang Uk grunts]

03:47.477 --> 03:50.063
I was not strong enough
to protect him from you.

03:50.897 --> 03:53.399
But I will not allow you
to live in my pupil's body.

03:59.197 --> 04:00.323
I didn't know…

04:01.241 --> 04:03.243
that you cared so much about Jang Uk.

04:03.993 --> 04:05.161
- Shut up!
- [grunts]

04:07.330 --> 04:08.414
Stop it!

04:09.582 --> 04:10.708
It's me, Jang Uk.

04:11.626 --> 04:12.877
Our souls didn't shift.

04:15.421 --> 04:16.923
Mu-deok, look into my eyes.

04:18.341 --> 04:19.801
Can't you tell it's me?

04:21.844 --> 04:24.222
[soft music playing]

04:24.305 --> 04:26.975
I'm the only person who can look at you
this close, remember?

04:30.770 --> 04:31.980
Don't you recognize me?

04:33.022 --> 04:35.024
[soft music continues playing]

05:28.661 --> 05:30.663
[suspenseful music playing]

05:33.791 --> 05:34.709
[yells]

05:35.418 --> 05:36.294
[screams]

05:43.676 --> 05:44.510
[grunts]

05:53.686 --> 05:55.938
[Mu-deok] He had the blue mark
of a shifter on his body.

05:57.815 --> 06:00.693
His soul must have re-entered his own body
instead of entering into mine.

06:01.778 --> 06:03.071
But why didn't I change?

06:03.154 --> 06:03.988
No.

06:04.822 --> 06:06.407
You've also changed. Look!

06:07.575 --> 06:09.911
I see you no longer trembling
without the binding bracelet.

06:12.371 --> 06:15.458
You're right.
I can freely move my arm now.

06:15.541 --> 06:17.919
The Soul Ejector has made
your energy surge.

06:18.002 --> 06:19.670
When you drank poison, your gate opened

06:19.754 --> 06:21.714
and then allowed it to surge
with the Soul Ejector.

06:22.799 --> 06:26.094
Jang Uk, you have no idea
how incredibly lucky you've been.

06:32.767 --> 06:35.686
I am quite certain that you were there.

06:36.521 --> 06:37.355
What?

06:42.652 --> 06:43.486
[Gil-ju grunts]

06:49.200 --> 06:50.827
[breathes heavily]

06:57.917 --> 06:59.127
Why am I…

07:00.253 --> 07:01.796
the only one like this?

07:01.879 --> 07:04.841
You failed because your energy was
too weak to take over his body.

07:04.924 --> 07:07.051
You're a soul shifter like me.

07:07.135 --> 07:08.970
Naksu, you will also…

07:09.887 --> 07:11.931
turn to stone eventually.

07:13.057 --> 07:15.476
Just like me now and…

07:16.269 --> 07:17.770
just like your father.

07:22.817 --> 07:23.901
My father?

07:24.569 --> 07:25.528
[Gil-ju] Yes.

07:26.070 --> 07:28.823
Your father,
the constellation recorder mage.

07:29.532 --> 07:30.491
Cho Chung!

07:30.575 --> 07:32.493
[tense music playing]

07:32.577 --> 07:33.828
My father was…

07:36.873 --> 07:38.040
a soul shifter?

07:41.210 --> 07:45.965
The four families of Daeho were not
the ones who destroyed your entire family.

07:47.508 --> 07:51.262
Your father ran wild
and murdered everyone.

07:53.389 --> 07:55.391
[nanny] Please, my lady!
You cannot leave here for anything.

07:55.475 --> 07:58.394
If you see your father, just run away.

07:58.478 --> 08:00.104
Please, do not get caught!

08:03.483 --> 08:07.737
Both father and daughter,
taken advantage of, and left to…

08:08.446 --> 08:10.573
be petrified and die.

08:11.741 --> 08:13.743
Is the person
who shifted my father's soul…

08:15.119 --> 08:16.120
the Danju,

08:17.580 --> 08:19.332
Jin Mu as in Cheonbugwan?

08:19.957 --> 08:22.960
Jin Mu is not the true Danju
of our organization.

08:23.669 --> 08:26.422
There is another hidden Danju
who runs everything.

08:27.465 --> 08:29.634
- Then who is that?
- They are someone…

08:30.885 --> 08:33.346
who can prevent you from running wild

08:34.347 --> 08:37.517
because they possess the ice stone.

08:37.600 --> 08:40.186
- So who is that? Who's the real one?
- [roars]

08:43.064 --> 08:44.023
[groaning]

08:47.485 --> 08:48.486
[Gil-ju yelling]

08:53.324 --> 08:54.158
- [Jang Uk grunts]
- [Gil-ju yelps]

09:04.627 --> 09:06.546
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok, you're all right?

09:06.629 --> 09:07.463
[groans]

09:07.964 --> 09:09.006
I'll be fine.

09:09.090 --> 09:09.966
[pants]

09:10.049 --> 09:11.842
Go after him. Hurry!

09:11.926 --> 09:12.760
[breathes roughly]

09:23.980 --> 09:25.314
[breathes heavily]

09:48.671 --> 09:50.506
[Mu-deok]
Before that sorcery's poison spreads

09:50.590 --> 09:52.800
throughout my body,
I have to get out of here.

10:00.141 --> 10:01.475
- [dog barking]
- [grunts in pain]

10:10.693 --> 10:12.695
[suspenseful music playing]

10:15.573 --> 10:17.283
[growling, barking]

10:18.159 --> 10:19.285
[Sang-ho] Search the area.

10:19.368 --> 10:20.202
[mage] Yes, sir.

10:20.995 --> 10:22.997
[suspenseful music continues playing]

10:37.178 --> 10:38.054
[gasps softly]

10:44.268 --> 10:45.227
There's no one here.

10:46.687 --> 10:47.897
[growling]

10:50.816 --> 10:52.693
But it sensed the energy of sorcery.

10:52.777 --> 10:55.863
Master Heo was right.
That Sapsali was really the Gwigu.

10:56.489 --> 10:58.783
Did the alchemy of souls
really take place here?

11:07.875 --> 11:08.793
What is that?

11:09.377 --> 11:10.461
It was just on the ground.

11:11.879 --> 11:13.130
A Soul Ejector.

11:18.969 --> 11:20.096
Look at this.

11:21.013 --> 11:23.015
This is not
Young Master Jang's binding bracelet?

11:23.099 --> 11:24.642
Why do you think it's here then?

11:25.393 --> 11:26.811
Does this mean Uk was here earlier?

11:31.774 --> 11:32.983
There are signs of a fight.

11:33.067 --> 11:35.027
You don't think
anything happened to him, do you?

11:38.572 --> 11:41.158
Sang-ho, return to Songrim
and report what you saw.

11:41.784 --> 11:44.036
Dang-gu, go back
to the fortress and search for Uk.

11:44.120 --> 11:46.038
- I'll look around here.
- Yeah.

11:50.167 --> 11:52.169
[dramatic music playing]

11:55.089 --> 11:56.006
[men panting]

12:13.732 --> 12:14.567
[grunts]

12:21.907 --> 12:24.410
How did the Songrim mages
know to come out here?

12:27.538 --> 12:28.372
[groans]

12:32.793 --> 12:34.420
[grunts, pants]

12:41.552 --> 12:43.304
[Gil-ju] You're a soul shifter like me.

12:43.888 --> 12:45.598
Naksu, you will also…

12:46.515 --> 12:48.184
turn to stone eventually.

12:48.809 --> 12:50.519
Just like me now,

12:50.603 --> 12:52.855
and just like your father.

12:56.775 --> 12:57.860
[whispers] Father.

13:00.279 --> 13:02.448
[somber music playing]

13:22.343 --> 13:23.969
[Gil-ju] Both father and daughter…

13:25.679 --> 13:28.224
taken advantage of, and left to…

13:29.683 --> 13:31.477
be petrified and die.

13:44.406 --> 13:45.241
[sobs]

13:52.581 --> 13:54.583
- [dramatic music playing]
- [barking]

13:58.504 --> 13:59.797
[dog barking]

14:02.132 --> 14:02.967
[grunts]

14:07.972 --> 14:09.390
[barking continues]

14:09.473 --> 14:11.475
[suspenseful music playing]

14:43.799 --> 14:45.801
[suspenseful music continues playing]

14:58.772 --> 14:59.648
[groans]

15:04.194 --> 15:05.070
[gasps]

15:05.154 --> 15:06.113
[pants]

15:18.292 --> 15:19.209
Why is it you?

15:20.461 --> 15:21.962
Why does it have to be you again?

15:22.046 --> 15:23.672
[somber music playing]

15:28.385 --> 15:30.679
Did you… catch her?

15:31.305 --> 15:32.973
This is Uk's servant, Mu-deok.

15:34.350 --> 15:36.644
She's hurt because of me.
She needs to be treated.

15:43.859 --> 15:46.070
[man 1] Phew, what a day! Not really bad!

15:46.153 --> 15:48.822
Business has been so good today.

15:54.870 --> 15:57.206
[Gil-ju] I need to refill
my energy before I petrify.

15:59.750 --> 16:01.835
- [man 2] Are you done?
- [man 3] Just finished.

16:02.336 --> 16:05.839
[man 2] Ah, come on,
let's go get a drink then. Hurry up!

16:05.923 --> 16:07.174
- [man 3] Let's go.
- [both laugh]

16:08.717 --> 16:10.386
[Gil-ju]
I can't return if I cause a scene.

16:11.220 --> 16:13.931
I need to find somewhere quiet
to take someone's energy.

16:34.994 --> 16:36.996
[ominous music playing]

17:05.190 --> 17:06.650
[Sun-i] Please, step to the side.

17:08.235 --> 17:09.820
Oh, yeah, sorry. Please, go ahead.

17:10.904 --> 17:11.864
Mage.

17:11.947 --> 17:14.199
We can all see right through
what you're trying to do.

17:15.451 --> 17:17.995
You have been following my lady
since we entered the fortress.

17:19.663 --> 17:21.290
[sneaky music playing]

17:25.502 --> 17:27.671
That man has been
following us for a while now.

17:31.592 --> 17:34.970
[Sun-i] You stalked her
all throughout the city and to this inn.

17:37.014 --> 17:38.932
There is a misunderstanding.
We're just going the same way.

17:39.016 --> 17:40.642
Misunderstanding!

17:40.726 --> 17:43.520
You were staring only at my lady
the entire time you were following us!

17:43.604 --> 17:44.730
I was not. No.

17:44.813 --> 17:45.814
[Yun-ok] Sun-i.

17:46.565 --> 17:48.776
That's enough. You're embarrassing him.

17:52.446 --> 17:56.283
Following me all the way to the inn,
puts me in an uncomfortable situation.

17:56.366 --> 17:59.119
If you do not wish me
to find a new inn at such a late hour,

17:59.203 --> 18:00.287
please, go now.

18:01.872 --> 18:03.165
One thing, miss.

18:03.999 --> 18:06.335
What gave you the idea
that I was even following you?

18:06.919 --> 18:08.796
It's not like you owe me
money or anything,

18:08.879 --> 18:10.130
and you're not someone already I know,

18:10.214 --> 18:12.132
so why do you think
I was following you then?

18:12.216 --> 18:13.801
Of course you were,
because my lady is so very pretty--

18:13.884 --> 18:15.177
Sun-i, just shut up for a second.

18:15.260 --> 18:16.637
[bird cawing]

18:16.720 --> 18:18.347
I only want you to answer me.

18:18.931 --> 18:19.765
Uh…

18:20.641 --> 18:24.728
I have had many men follow me
because they found me very attractive.

18:24.812 --> 18:25.813
So I thought…

18:27.189 --> 18:28.816
you were doing the same thing.

18:29.399 --> 18:30.234
Ah.

18:31.151 --> 18:31.985
Incorrect.

18:34.363 --> 18:35.614
Your looks don't impress me.

18:36.448 --> 18:38.617
I wasn't following you,
so you're wrong there, too.

18:39.868 --> 18:41.161
I-If that's true…

18:43.205 --> 18:44.540
I apologize.

18:44.623 --> 18:46.542
Then I'm free to
go up the stairs right now?

18:59.012 --> 19:01.473
- [Sun-i] My lady.
- Huh?

19:01.557 --> 19:03.183
You really must eat something.

19:04.101 --> 19:05.144
[sighs]

19:05.227 --> 19:06.061
Did that scum…

19:07.354 --> 19:08.939
I mean… Do…

19:09.022 --> 19:10.065
Do you dread the possibility

19:10.149 --> 19:11.900
of running into that man again
so you're starving yourself?

19:13.443 --> 19:14.570
That's not why.

19:15.404 --> 19:16.905
I'm just not feeling well.

19:17.489 --> 19:19.241
Change out of those wet clothes.

19:19.324 --> 19:21.451
I'll go and make some porridge for you.

19:24.413 --> 19:25.247
[sighs]

19:29.251 --> 19:31.461
[ominous music playing]

19:55.485 --> 19:56.445
[footsteps approaching]

19:59.948 --> 20:00.782
[gasps]

20:02.075 --> 20:04.077
[dramatic music playing]

20:04.995 --> 20:05.829
[Yun-ok whimpers]

20:09.208 --> 20:10.209
[breathes heavily]

20:15.797 --> 20:17.382
- [roars]
- [screams]

20:17.466 --> 20:18.884
[sword swishing]

20:18.967 --> 20:20.761
[intense music playing]

20:41.073 --> 20:43.116
[roars]

20:45.577 --> 20:46.453
[Jang Uk grunts]

20:53.293 --> 20:54.127
[pants]

20:57.130 --> 20:58.006
[breathing shakily]

21:02.469 --> 21:04.429
- Are you all right?
- [gasps]

21:06.974 --> 21:07.849
What was that?

21:08.684 --> 21:09.726
That thing?

21:11.019 --> 21:12.562
Was that the thing you were following?

21:13.438 --> 21:14.273
Yes.

21:16.483 --> 21:18.110
I'm just glad you are unhurt, though.

21:18.944 --> 21:19.820
Please, wait.

21:21.738 --> 21:23.156
Thank you for saving me.

21:23.240 --> 21:24.533
If you're feeling unwell,

21:25.575 --> 21:27.327
visit Sejukwon in Songrim.

21:27.411 --> 21:28.954
[Yun-ok] Do you really know Sejukwon?

21:29.037 --> 21:30.247
I am Sejukwon's…

21:34.876 --> 21:36.211
Heo Yun-ok.

21:36.753 --> 21:37.671
[exhales softly]

21:45.470 --> 21:46.388
[groans]

21:48.223 --> 21:49.599
[breathes heavily]

21:55.897 --> 21:58.567
[Mu-deok] Seeing as it's in
your possession instead of your friend's,

22:00.235 --> 22:02.112
I'll take it that
your friend is no longer here.

22:05.657 --> 22:06.783
So then you knew…

22:08.952 --> 22:10.454
who I was this entire time.

22:15.000 --> 22:15.834
[sighs]

22:15.917 --> 22:17.878
[soft music playing]

22:42.277 --> 22:43.111
[groans]

22:57.250 --> 22:58.126
[Gil-ju grunts]

22:59.211 --> 23:00.712
[groans in pain]

23:08.053 --> 23:09.304
- [all gasp]
- [man] What was that?

23:10.305 --> 23:11.223
[groans]

23:11.723 --> 23:12.974
[man] Are you okay?

23:13.058 --> 23:14.768
Hey, are you okay? Are you all right?

23:14.851 --> 23:18.313
T-Try to get up, okay?
Ah, okay, slowly, slowly.

23:19.439 --> 23:20.440
[all exclaim]

23:21.274 --> 23:22.818
I-It's a monster!

23:22.901 --> 23:24.194
- [grunts]
- [man screams]

23:24.903 --> 23:25.946
A soul shifter.

23:26.029 --> 23:27.114
[shouts] Soul shifter!

23:27.197 --> 23:29.449
[all shriek]

23:34.496 --> 23:35.455
[grunts]

23:43.588 --> 23:45.674
[man] Run! Run! Get out of here!

23:50.345 --> 23:51.888
[grunts, breathes heavily]

24:02.649 --> 24:05.318
There is another hidden Danju
who runs everything.

24:06.444 --> 24:10.115
They are someone
who can prevent you from running wild.

24:10.198 --> 24:12.826
[Jang Uk] All right, show me
where your Danju is then.

24:15.245 --> 24:16.830
Gil-ju's gone missing?

24:16.913 --> 24:20.667
After he tried to chase
Jang Uk's servant, we lost track of him.

24:22.210 --> 24:23.795
Jang Uk's servant? Why?

24:24.421 --> 24:26.131
Why would he go after her?

24:26.214 --> 24:29.926
In truth, he has been following
Jang Uk for quite a while now.

24:30.969 --> 24:34.681
The Songrim Spirit Plaque
that Naksu had was in fact Jang Uk's.

24:35.432 --> 24:37.017
I believe that he went after Jang Uk

24:37.100 --> 24:38.560
because he thought
he was connected to Naksu.

24:38.643 --> 24:40.770
You should have told me
as soon as you knew!

24:41.479 --> 24:42.731
He ordered me not to.

24:42.814 --> 24:45.192
I thought he wanted to find
evidence before reporting to you.

24:45.775 --> 24:47.903
Order all of the mages
in Cheonbugwan to search for him.

24:54.159 --> 24:55.827
[Heo Yeom] You found Uk's binding bracelet

24:55.911 --> 24:58.371
in the same place as the alchemy of souls?

24:58.455 --> 24:59.956
Dang-gu is looking for Master Jang.

25:00.040 --> 25:02.083
And Young Master Seo is searching
around the temple.

25:02.167 --> 25:04.794
- So, those children were also there, then?
- [Sang-ho] Yes.

25:04.878 --> 25:08.924
With his abilities, I doubt that
Uk is capable of the alchemy of souls.

25:09.007 --> 25:10.342
Master Lee,

25:10.425 --> 25:12.928
what if someone took over
his body using sorcery?

25:13.011 --> 25:15.555
You have nothing to worry about.
I'm sure he's fine.

25:20.393 --> 25:22.562
That girl will certainly protect him.

25:22.646 --> 25:23.813
By the way,

25:23.897 --> 25:27.108
where did our leader run off to
in the midst of this chaos, huh?

25:28.526 --> 25:30.070
Before Uk was ever born…

25:31.988 --> 25:33.573
close to about 20 years ago…

25:34.616 --> 25:35.450
did Jang Gang

25:36.493 --> 25:38.119
perform the alchemy of souls?

25:39.621 --> 25:40.789
[thunder rumbles]

25:41.706 --> 25:42.582
[exhales sharply]

25:43.583 --> 25:45.877
Cheonbugwan's Gwanju performing sorcery?

25:46.670 --> 25:48.004
[chuckles] That is absolutely absurd.

25:48.088 --> 25:49.297
Jin Mu told me all about it.

25:50.924 --> 25:52.842
I couldn't bear to hear it from his mouth,

25:54.386 --> 25:55.971
so I came to you instead.

26:00.433 --> 26:01.476
Madam Do-hwa…

26:03.061 --> 26:04.729
was indeed once concerned about it.

26:05.772 --> 26:08.692
The Gwanju seemed to have
an interest in strange spells.

26:09.526 --> 26:12.737
But it was only…
for a brief amount of time.

26:13.405 --> 26:15.615
For nearly a year, he was hardly home,

26:16.283 --> 26:19.828
and would spend hours
with Jin Mu practicing spells.

26:19.911 --> 26:20.870
However,

26:20.954 --> 26:24.749
after Do-hwa was pregnant
with the Young Master, he soon stopped.

26:28.670 --> 26:30.297
[Gang] The child that
Do-hwa has given birth to

26:30.839 --> 26:32.382
is the son of the late king.

26:33.216 --> 26:34.092
The late king

26:35.093 --> 26:37.804
died from an illness so severe that,
in his final days, he couldn't even move.

26:37.887 --> 26:39.264
So how is that possible?

26:41.224 --> 26:44.477
With the alchemy of souls,
it would have been possible.

26:46.646 --> 26:48.023
It was nothing more…

26:49.357 --> 26:51.526
than a mage's fleeting curiosity.

26:51.609 --> 26:52.527
[Jin] It wasn't.

26:53.862 --> 26:55.155
Against Do-hwa…

26:56.656 --> 26:57.907
and Uk as well.

26:58.700 --> 27:02.704
Jang Gang had committed
an unforgivable crime.

27:13.006 --> 27:16.384
A mage from Jeongjingak is here,
urgently searching for the young master.

27:18.053 --> 27:20.013
[suspenseful music playing]

27:26.186 --> 27:27.896
You were here as well, my lord?

27:27.979 --> 27:29.272
What is it?

27:30.106 --> 27:31.441
Ugh, I'm afraid…

27:32.484 --> 27:34.277
Uk's fallen victim
to the alchemy of souls.

27:35.362 --> 27:36.196
What?

27:36.279 --> 27:37.113
[gasps]

27:43.828 --> 27:45.246
[breathes heavily]

27:46.706 --> 27:48.708
[ominous music playing]

28:00.678 --> 28:01.638
[Jang Uk] That's Cheonbugwan.

28:02.472 --> 28:05.392
Could the real Danju be in Cheonbugwan?

28:09.270 --> 28:10.146
[grunts]

28:19.239 --> 28:20.782
[breathes heavily]

28:28.915 --> 28:31.459
This goes straight to the royal palace.

28:32.293 --> 28:34.796
Is it possible that
the real Danju is in the palace?

28:44.973 --> 28:46.766
[Gil-ju] I am here from Cheonbugwan.

28:46.850 --> 28:48.601
[soldier] More business tonight,
I take it.

28:51.187 --> 28:52.230
[Gil-ju breathing heavily]

28:56.776 --> 28:58.027
Show me your face.

28:58.111 --> 29:00.029
[Gil-ju] This is urgent. Move aside.

29:00.113 --> 29:01.406
Take off your hood and show me your face!

29:08.663 --> 29:10.707
[suspenseful music playing]

29:13.126 --> 29:14.544
[all yell]

29:15.253 --> 29:16.129
[screams in pain]

29:16.212 --> 29:18.006
[men grunting]

29:23.928 --> 29:24.971
A soul shifter.

29:27.932 --> 29:28.808
[soldier] Go!

29:32.228 --> 29:33.271
[passer-by exclaims]

29:33.354 --> 29:34.189
[yelling]

29:49.829 --> 29:50.663
[Gil-ju grunts]

29:58.880 --> 30:00.215
- [grunts in pain]
- [passer-by exclaims]

30:00.298 --> 30:02.300
[dramatic music playing]

30:08.932 --> 30:09.766
[yells]

30:30.161 --> 30:31.579
[Gil-ju growls]

30:37.043 --> 30:38.002
[Gil-ju groans]

30:46.678 --> 30:47.595
[breathes heavily]

30:55.019 --> 30:56.646
[water splashes]

30:56.729 --> 30:58.773
[intense music playing]

31:12.161 --> 31:13.663
[breathes heavily]

31:16.833 --> 31:18.835
[Jang Uk] The real Danju is
inside the palace then.

31:21.421 --> 31:22.755
The ice stone, was it?

31:23.923 --> 31:25.466
That's the name of it, right?

31:27.135 --> 31:30.305
I'll find it, and prevent her
from sharing your fate.

31:31.222 --> 31:33.558
[roars]

31:40.857 --> 31:41.691
[grunts]

31:42.609 --> 31:44.235
[Gil-ju body crackling]

31:50.199 --> 31:52.201
[somber music playing]

32:05.423 --> 32:06.507
[man 1] He's alive?

32:06.591 --> 32:08.176
[indistinct chatter]

32:08.843 --> 32:10.929
[all exclaim fearfully]

32:14.349 --> 32:15.808
[birds chirping]

32:26.861 --> 32:29.489
He tried to enter the palace
while running wild.

32:30.698 --> 32:31.950
So, did you and your men kill him?

32:33.034 --> 32:34.452
[soldier] We didn't dare to.

32:34.535 --> 32:37.372
An unknown mage suddenly appeared
and he used magic to kill him.

32:38.122 --> 32:40.375
Which family was he from?
Did you see his face?

32:40.458 --> 32:42.919
He had it covered
by a blue cloth, I couldn't.

32:43.002 --> 32:44.754
However, I know the spell he used.

32:45.338 --> 32:46.255
[water splashes]

32:51.219 --> 32:52.387
It was Tansu.

32:55.848 --> 32:59.352
- Tansu, you say?
- [soldier] Yes, I'm certain it was Tansu.

32:59.852 --> 33:02.105
He flicked his energy with his sword.

33:04.107 --> 33:06.609
[Jin Mu]
Tansu was Naksu's signature skill.

33:07.276 --> 33:09.737
What other mages use that ability?

33:19.330 --> 33:21.791
I heard that you caught
a soul shifter who ran wild.

33:22.417 --> 33:25.753
We came here to see
with our own eyes who it was.

33:27.046 --> 33:29.966
Of course. Please see it for yourself.

33:46.858 --> 33:47.692
[sighs in relief]

33:53.865 --> 33:54.699
This man…

33:55.867 --> 33:58.661
is Gil-ju, isn't he? One of yours.

34:00.580 --> 34:02.749
So? It is.

34:05.168 --> 34:07.837
Bring his body inside. Send everyone away.

34:07.920 --> 34:08.796
Yes, lord.

34:14.427 --> 34:17.930
[Jin] Jin Mu was with me
when the alchemy of souls was performed.

34:18.431 --> 34:20.933
He seems just as perplexed.

34:21.017 --> 34:24.353
He wasn't aware
about this soul shifter, either.

34:26.189 --> 34:29.567
Since this incident occurred within
Cheonbugwan, I will investigate it.

34:29.650 --> 34:31.360
Songrim should not intervene.

34:32.070 --> 34:32.945
Of course.

34:33.905 --> 34:36.866
However, if you need our aid,

34:37.450 --> 34:39.786
do not hesitate to ask us.

34:42.288 --> 34:44.832
[Sun] Another soul shifter was found
running wild?

34:44.916 --> 34:48.544
Fortunately, he was caught
and eventually petrified.

34:48.628 --> 34:50.254
Did they identify the soul shifter?

34:50.755 --> 34:53.591
It was a mage from Cheonbugwan.

34:53.674 --> 34:55.009
The mage Gil-ju.

34:57.053 --> 34:59.597
[Sun] Gil-ju turned into a soul shifter?

35:00.181 --> 35:03.267
Then he was caught here in Cheonbugwan?

35:03.351 --> 35:05.353
He was caught right
in front of the palace, my king.

35:05.436 --> 35:08.481
He tried to enter the palace
after he was already running wild.

35:09.440 --> 35:11.150
He tried to get into the palace?

35:11.234 --> 35:13.402
[eunuch] Yes. But before he could,
a mage appeared

35:13.486 --> 35:15.613
and subdued him using Tansu, sire.

35:18.950 --> 35:20.993
And do we know who this mage was?

35:21.077 --> 35:22.453
[thrilling music playing]

35:22.537 --> 35:24.664
The person who killed
Gil-ju had to be Naksu.

35:24.747 --> 35:25.998
- [indistinct background chatter]
- [man 1] Naksu? Really?

35:26.082 --> 35:27.500
Naksu has really returned!

35:27.583 --> 35:29.460
- [man 1] Naksu came back?
- [man 2] The assassin Naksu?

35:30.002 --> 35:31.295
That mage last night who appeared

35:31.379 --> 35:34.048
in front of the palace had to use
Tansu to stop him.

35:34.132 --> 35:35.925
- The very same skill that Naksu uses!
- [exclaiming]

35:36.008 --> 35:37.718
[chattering]

35:39.262 --> 35:40.555
Hang on! Just a moment!

35:40.638 --> 35:41.973
Isn't Naksu dead?

35:42.056 --> 35:42.890
[man 1] He's right. She is dead.

35:42.974 --> 35:45.935
She has to be dead. Everyone
in this city watched her body burn.

35:46.018 --> 35:48.354
Even I saw it with my own two eyes.
So what do you say?

35:48.437 --> 35:49.397
[woman] Yeah, he's right.

35:49.480 --> 35:52.108
Her body may have burned,
but her soul is still here.

35:52.191 --> 35:55.570
The Shadow Assassin, Naksu,
must have returned as a soul shifter!

35:55.653 --> 35:57.321
- [indistinct chattering]
- What?

35:59.407 --> 36:01.284
But Naksu is a woman, isn't she?

36:01.367 --> 36:03.411
They're saying a man killed Gil-ju.

36:03.494 --> 36:06.664
He was a tall, young man
who had a blue cloth covering his face.

36:07.331 --> 36:09.333
Naksu shifted her soul, didn't she?

36:09.417 --> 36:12.086
She could have shifted
into that tall man's body.

36:12.170 --> 36:13.379
[gasps] Ah!

36:13.880 --> 36:16.090
Then she could have become even stronger.

36:17.300 --> 36:18.968
Naksu was already so powerful.

36:19.051 --> 36:20.303
Now she's pretty much invincible,

36:20.386 --> 36:22.513
now that she's shifted
into a much stronger body.

36:24.724 --> 36:26.142
She must have murdered Gil-ju

36:26.225 --> 36:28.644
in order to get her revenge on Cheonbugwan

36:29.353 --> 36:30.855
for burning her body and killing her men.

36:30.938 --> 36:31.898
Why us though…

36:32.440 --> 36:34.358
when it was actually Songrim
that killed Naksu?

36:35.318 --> 36:37.737
So, then "Naksu, who has returned

36:37.820 --> 36:40.072
as this invincible being
dressed in blue cloth,

36:40.156 --> 36:42.742
has set her next target as Songrim".

36:42.825 --> 36:45.995
At least, that's the rumor
that I've overheard there.

36:46.078 --> 36:48.539
It's been less than half a day
since they were captured,

36:49.040 --> 36:50.833
and already
people are spreading such lies.

36:51.417 --> 36:55.213
Rumors like that spread
like wildfire and are often exaggerated.

36:55.296 --> 36:56.964
But that rumor isn't without some truth.

36:57.048 --> 37:00.009
They're saying that the mage
who killed Gil-ju used Tansu,

37:00.092 --> 37:02.470
and that's the skill Naksu used to use.

37:02.553 --> 37:04.472
Who says that Naksu is
the only one who can use Tansu?

37:04.555 --> 37:05.389
[Heo Yeom grumbles]

37:06.057 --> 37:08.768
That's the skill that even I could master
if I wanted to right now.

37:08.851 --> 37:10.478
Oh, but… [sighs]

37:10.561 --> 37:12.772
If I ever hear such rumors in Songrim,

37:13.356 --> 37:15.441
I will assume that
you were the one who spread them, Dang-gu.

37:15.524 --> 37:16.442
[Jin] So don't let it happen.

37:17.235 --> 37:18.069
[Dang-gu] Sir.

37:21.656 --> 37:24.659
At least, I can be relieved
that the dead soul shifter

37:24.742 --> 37:26.160
was not the Young Master.

37:27.078 --> 37:30.289
But then, why were his items found
all the way up there?

37:31.457 --> 37:34.168
- [sighs]
- We will have our answer once we find him.

37:40.216 --> 37:42.760
Oh, you don't look so good.

37:49.475 --> 37:50.977
[exhales] So…

37:52.144 --> 37:54.480
please, go home and wait for Jang Uk.

37:59.360 --> 38:00.236
[chuckles]

38:01.821 --> 38:02.655
[maid Kim sighs]

38:02.738 --> 38:04.740
[whimsical music playing]

38:04.824 --> 38:06.534
[Jin] Do you feel unwell?

38:07.159 --> 38:10.204
I was so surprised
that last night's honey biscuits

38:10.288 --> 38:12.290
have been giving me indigestion.

38:12.373 --> 38:13.207
[coughs]

38:14.333 --> 38:17.295
When I had heard that
the Young Master's soul had been shifted,

38:17.378 --> 38:19.714
my soul shifted in and out of my own body.

38:20.715 --> 38:21.549
[sighs]

38:27.805 --> 38:30.266
Did your soul really return here?

38:33.185 --> 38:34.520
Is that really you?

38:35.354 --> 38:37.857
No, my lord. I'm Maidservant Park.

38:39.275 --> 38:41.152
Maybe then,
I could smack Young Master Park

38:41.235 --> 38:42.695
for scaring me like that.

38:43.487 --> 38:44.697
- [Jin smacks lips]
- [sighs]

38:44.780 --> 38:46.198
You can hit me instead.

38:48.576 --> 38:50.703
For Maidservant Park, of course.

38:51.746 --> 38:52.830
Go on and hit me.

38:52.913 --> 38:54.665
Maid Park has quite a good arm.

38:54.749 --> 38:56.584
Even someone like you can get hurt by it.

38:57.585 --> 38:59.795
I promise that I won't whine
if it ends up hurting,

38:59.879 --> 39:01.172
so go on and hit me.

39:01.756 --> 39:02.882
[maid Kim] Oh!

39:04.800 --> 39:07.720
This means that you now owe me.

39:09.055 --> 39:10.348
What do you mean?

39:11.057 --> 39:13.184
Are you going to do something to upset me?

39:13.267 --> 39:15.770
If that's the case,
please, just take it back.

39:15.853 --> 39:17.188
Hit me once so we're even.

39:18.022 --> 39:19.148
Go on. Hit me!

39:20.107 --> 39:21.567
Go ahead and hit me.

39:21.650 --> 39:22.568
[exclaims]

39:27.239 --> 39:28.449
I don't want…

39:28.532 --> 39:30.117
[soft music playing]

39:30.201 --> 39:31.869
…to ever see you get hurt.

39:34.246 --> 39:36.415
There is so much that I need to protect,

39:37.458 --> 39:40.419
so I may have to be harsh
and ruthless from time to time.

39:41.087 --> 39:42.254
But I do promise you

39:43.547 --> 39:45.132
I never wish to hurt you.

39:50.888 --> 39:52.181
Are you then troubled

39:52.765 --> 39:54.058
of what you asked me yesterday?

39:55.017 --> 39:56.227
About Master Jang Gang?

39:56.811 --> 39:58.771
There's been a lot of disorder lately.

39:58.854 --> 40:00.856
And I have failed to be impartial

40:01.857 --> 40:03.818
as the current leader of Songrim.

40:04.777 --> 40:06.904
But after you hit me,
I've come to my senses.

40:07.738 --> 40:10.950
And now will resolve
the problems critically, too.

40:15.121 --> 40:17.039
So, turn into Maidservant Park and…

40:18.374 --> 40:19.959
hit me every now and then, would you?

40:21.877 --> 40:22.795
I will…

40:24.046 --> 40:25.631
allow that for you.

40:29.552 --> 40:30.386
[both chuckles softly]

40:40.271 --> 40:41.105
Oh.

40:41.814 --> 40:42.731
What are you doing here?

40:43.232 --> 40:45.776
I was ordered to find
the origin of the sorcery.

40:45.860 --> 40:48.154
Then I found this out here.

40:49.155 --> 40:50.781
Ah, I must have left that behind.

40:52.700 --> 40:54.243
Do you not need the binding bracelet?

40:55.286 --> 40:57.079
No. I guess I'm fine now.

40:57.788 --> 41:00.249
I can't believe I almost lost
another Jin family treasure.

41:01.333 --> 41:02.585
Thank you for finding it.

41:04.003 --> 41:05.713
You also left something else behind.

41:07.006 --> 41:08.841
Did you forget about Mu-deok?

41:10.885 --> 41:11.927
Mu-deok you said?

41:13.721 --> 41:15.306
I found her hiding in the forest.

41:16.765 --> 41:19.685
Injured. Lost quite a bit of blood.

41:23.022 --> 41:23.856
[Jang Uk exhales]

41:29.612 --> 41:30.779
[sighs]

41:35.034 --> 41:35.910
Mu-deok.

41:37.119 --> 41:39.246
Ah, Young Master. Come on.

41:39.330 --> 41:41.790
How could you dare run off
and leave me all on my own?

41:41.874 --> 41:42.875
What?

41:44.627 --> 41:48.088
Hey, you just selfishly ran away
and left me to fend for myself.

41:48.923 --> 41:50.424
[whispers]
Just play along. Play along!

41:50.508 --> 41:51.967
[bird cawing]

41:54.136 --> 41:57.223
Right, I did. Yeah, I, uh, I ran away.

41:57.806 --> 41:58.766
Yeah.

41:58.849 --> 42:00.267
We came to shelter from the rain

42:00.351 --> 42:02.144
and we were unlucky
to witness the sorcery.

42:02.228 --> 42:04.563
But because you ran off
leaving me to my own devices,

42:04.647 --> 42:06.899
I almost got ripped apart
by that soul shifter.

42:09.401 --> 42:10.444
I'm sorry, Mu-deok.

42:11.445 --> 42:15.824
I was just so scared, and I wasn't even
thinking when I ran to save my own life.

42:15.908 --> 42:17.243
[laughs awkwardly]

42:17.326 --> 42:20.704
Yul thought Mu-deok was
the soul shifter and he nearly killed her.

42:21.372 --> 42:24.833
If he hadn't treated her right away,
she would have died.

42:29.964 --> 42:31.423
Oh, Yul, you--

42:31.507 --> 42:32.883
Wow, you rescued Mu-deok, and you…

42:32.967 --> 42:35.511
and you even treated her.
That was kind! Wow!

42:41.308 --> 42:43.102
Did you really run away
and leave her behind?

42:48.899 --> 42:50.859
If I'd fought, I'm sure
I would just have died.

42:51.360 --> 42:53.404
We need to be a bit selfish sometimes.

42:54.530 --> 42:56.365
[Jang Uk] Why are you staring?
Don't you agree?

42:57.783 --> 43:01.287
Regardless, I'm all right
and you're fine as well, Young Master.

43:01.829 --> 43:02.830
So, it's all fine.

43:04.123 --> 43:04.999
[Jang Uk sighs]

43:19.555 --> 43:21.390
I heard you were hiding in Danhyanggok.

43:21.974 --> 43:23.851
Did you hear that our leader

43:23.934 --> 43:26.061
held Songrim accountable
for your own dishonor?

43:26.145 --> 43:27.646
Oh, this old man.

43:28.397 --> 43:30.816
Why would he do that
if I'm not allowed into Songrim?

43:30.899 --> 43:33.027
The duel with the Crown Prince
is in about two weeks.

43:33.652 --> 43:35.613
[mage]
Until then, just stay out of the fortress,

43:35.696 --> 43:37.239
and don't create any more trouble.

43:37.323 --> 43:38.532
Continue to lie low.

43:38.616 --> 43:39.450
[sniffs]

43:40.993 --> 43:41.827
[sighs]

43:44.538 --> 43:46.790
Thank you very much
for treating my injury.

43:46.874 --> 43:48.959
Uk seems fine
without the binding bracelet on him.

43:50.044 --> 43:52.254
I suppose he can control
his energy on his arm now.

43:54.548 --> 43:57.426
Once again, he risked his life
and got exactly what he had wanted.

43:57.509 --> 43:59.011
Once again, you're with him.

44:01.889 --> 44:05.601
If I'm such a bother to you,
you should have just left me to die then.

44:06.226 --> 44:07.061
Next time…

44:09.104 --> 44:10.522
I might have to do just that.

44:17.196 --> 44:18.030
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok.

44:19.657 --> 44:20.908
Yes. Coming, Young Master.

44:23.577 --> 44:24.453
Let's go now.

44:30.584 --> 44:32.628
[Seo Yul] Uk is fine. He's not injured.

44:33.545 --> 44:34.463
I'm glad.

44:35.381 --> 44:38.384
Did you happen to see who was with Gil-ju

44:38.467 --> 44:39.885
when he shifted his soul?

44:39.968 --> 44:42.888
That person probably was
the one with the blue cloth.

44:42.971 --> 44:45.391
He said he was focused on running.
He didn't see anyone.

44:45.474 --> 44:47.142
What about Jang Uk's servant then?

44:48.602 --> 44:50.354
She might have witnessed
the spell he used.

44:53.357 --> 44:54.191
Mu-deok…

45:00.614 --> 45:02.825
probably wouldn't even know
what she was looking at.

45:03.992 --> 45:06.745
After all, she's nothing
more than an ordinary servant.

45:09.415 --> 45:11.583
What is wrong with your hand?

45:13.335 --> 45:14.169
How did it get injured?

45:16.713 --> 45:19.758
When I touched the Soul Ejector,
some of the poison burned me.

45:20.592 --> 45:21.677
Honestly, I'm fine.

45:23.345 --> 45:24.721
Would you please excuse me?

45:34.022 --> 45:35.983
[somber music playing]

46:01.133 --> 46:01.967
[Dang-gu clears throat]

46:02.843 --> 46:04.678
So what do you want from me this time?

46:06.555 --> 46:08.640
I heard my wedding gifts
arrived the other day,

46:08.724 --> 46:10.767
and that you had taken them,
Young Master Park.

46:11.852 --> 46:12.728
Why?

46:12.811 --> 46:15.939
Were you worried I might lash out
and destroy them if I saw them all?

46:16.023 --> 46:17.316
I can keep them stored for you

46:17.399 --> 46:19.860
and then give them back
to you at your next wedding.

46:20.569 --> 46:21.987
Just throw them away.

46:22.070 --> 46:24.531
I'll never get married
to anyone, not after this.

46:25.574 --> 46:27.534
You don't have to be
embarrassed by any of this.

46:27.618 --> 46:30.162
This time, your marriage was
arranged in secret,

46:30.245 --> 46:31.538
so how many people can know about it?

46:34.124 --> 46:35.125
You-- You think so?

46:35.209 --> 46:36.376
Mm.

46:37.377 --> 46:39.505
- [lady 1] Cho-yeon! Hey!
- [lady 2] Cho-yeon!

46:43.133 --> 46:44.885
Cho-yeon! I heard
you're getting married again.

46:45.511 --> 46:47.471
Did I hear right that
you already bought wedding gifts

46:47.554 --> 46:49.264
and hired a craftsman to make your rings.

46:49.348 --> 46:52.100
It seems people have found out.

46:52.184 --> 46:53.101
- [giggling]
- [lady 2] Congrats!

46:53.185 --> 46:56.021
- Congratulations, Young Master Park.
- [giggles]

46:56.104 --> 46:58.774
- What? Me?
- I heard you two are getting married.

46:58.857 --> 47:00.692
He's the one who accepted
the wedding gifts,

47:00.776 --> 47:02.611
and went with you to pick up your rings.

47:02.694 --> 47:03.820
That true?

47:03.904 --> 47:06.740
There was an absurd rumor floating
around that you are marrying Uk again.

47:07.324 --> 47:08.283
But that's not true, right?

47:08.367 --> 47:10.035
You're marrying Young Master Park, right?

47:11.703 --> 47:12.746
Yes, that's true.

47:12.829 --> 47:14.748
Uh, but could you keep quiet for now?

47:14.831 --> 47:15.916
It's still a secret.

47:16.875 --> 47:18.001
- [giggles]
- Sure.

47:18.627 --> 47:19.795
See you later.

47:21.046 --> 47:23.423
See! I told you it had to be Dang-gu.

47:23.507 --> 47:25.342
- [lady 2] She's not crazy…
- [giggling]

47:30.931 --> 47:32.015
Young Master Park,

47:32.099 --> 47:33.892
why did you tell them
we were getting married?

47:34.476 --> 47:36.770
Instead of you
being rejected by him twice,

47:37.396 --> 47:40.190
let's say that you were the one
who dumped me this time.

47:40.274 --> 47:42.067
After all, it will just be a rumor.

47:43.694 --> 47:45.988
Would you be all right doing that?

47:46.947 --> 47:48.490
You'll end up being embarrassed.

47:49.741 --> 47:50.951
That will be fine by me.

48:12.014 --> 48:13.974
[reminiscent music playing]

48:18.937 --> 48:19.896
Filthy Mu-deok?

48:21.481 --> 48:23.942
Are you back here again?
Are you all right?

48:24.943 --> 48:25.944
Pardon?

48:28.864 --> 48:30.407
Never mind. You can go.

48:35.537 --> 48:37.664
Are you looking for Mu-deok again, sire?

48:37.748 --> 48:40.667
No, I'm not.
Her dress just looked familiar to me.

48:40.751 --> 48:41.793
Ah!

48:41.877 --> 48:44.171
Mu-deok sold us that dress a few days ago.

48:45.088 --> 48:47.090
- She sold that dress to you?
- Yes.

48:47.174 --> 48:49.509
She said some thoughtless,
young men had given it to her.

48:50.177 --> 48:51.595
She sold the dress saying that

48:51.678 --> 48:53.639
he was well-off and wouldn't want it back.

48:55.265 --> 48:57.893
Did filthy Mu-deok
really say that about it?

48:57.976 --> 49:01.772
Yes. Filthy Mu-deok and silk
do not pair well after all, of course.

49:02.731 --> 49:03.982
Watch what you say about her.

49:04.733 --> 49:05.609
Sorry?

49:05.692 --> 49:09.071
Filthy Mu-deok is my name for her.
Only I can call her that.

49:09.154 --> 49:10.280
Don't call her that.

49:10.364 --> 49:12.282
Uh, I'm sorry, sire.

49:14.034 --> 49:15.077
Also…

49:17.162 --> 49:19.456
Filthy Mu-deok wore it surprisingly well.

49:20.165 --> 49:22.542
At least, she looked
better than you in that blue shawl.

49:23.126 --> 49:24.795
This must be much uglier than I thought.

49:26.630 --> 49:27.631
What is it?

49:27.714 --> 49:30.342
When I came in, I noticed
that everyone is wearing one.

49:30.425 --> 49:32.469
This is the cloth that Naksu wore.

49:32.552 --> 49:33.595
Whose cloth?

49:33.679 --> 49:35.722
The soul shifter Naksu killed
in front of the palace

49:35.806 --> 49:37.057
was a mage from Cheonbugwan.

49:37.641 --> 49:39.810
Supposedly, she wore
a blue cloth just like this one.

49:39.893 --> 49:43.522
Wearing a blue cloth has become
quite a trend throughout the fortress.

49:44.398 --> 49:46.400
[thrilling music playing]

49:49.069 --> 49:51.196
Come! Come buy Naksu's blue cloth.

49:51.279 --> 49:52.322
[indistinct chattering]

49:52.406 --> 49:54.157
[merchant]
It can even block the alchemy of souls!

49:54.241 --> 49:55.659
[woman] Oh my, let me see.

49:55.742 --> 49:57.035
[laughs]

49:58.245 --> 50:00.455
[indistinct chattering]

50:05.127 --> 50:07.212
[Seo Yul] The soul shifter in blue, Naksu.

50:08.338 --> 50:10.590
Even the people are certain
to think Naksu is back.

50:12.300 --> 50:16.138
But of course, thanks to
the appearance of the Naksu in Blue,

50:16.221 --> 50:18.890
they're not talking about
Uk's match with the Prince.

50:20.058 --> 50:21.977
I wonder where Uk and Mu-deok have gone.

50:23.145 --> 50:24.521
They didn't go back to Danhyanggok.

50:25.397 --> 50:26.857
I'm sure they're somewhere safe.

50:27.566 --> 50:30.193
They'll return… at least for the fight.

50:32.654 --> 50:34.281
Uh, by the way…

50:36.867 --> 50:38.577
I got one too. Do you want to try it on?

50:43.373 --> 50:44.207
[sighs softly]

50:44.291 --> 50:45.125
[Dang-gu] Hmm…

50:46.042 --> 50:46.960
Wow!

50:49.838 --> 50:52.382
Who do you think they are?
This Naksu in Blue

50:52.466 --> 50:55.635
who uses Tansu just like her,
wearing a blue cloth?

50:58.472 --> 50:59.306
Hmm.

51:03.518 --> 51:06.271
[Jang Uk] You said this is
the grave site of soul shifters, right?

51:07.355 --> 51:08.940
Then he must be down there as well.

51:10.817 --> 51:11.943
Your father, I mean.

51:13.904 --> 51:15.030
As a little girl,

51:16.031 --> 51:19.785
I thought he was unjustly murdered
by the mages of the four families.

51:21.495 --> 51:24.080
When Jin Mu took me in,
I served him as the Danju.

51:24.164 --> 51:24.998
But now…

51:26.875 --> 51:29.461
it turned out that my own father
practiced sorcery, and…

51:31.087 --> 51:33.381
they just abandoned me after they used me.

51:36.968 --> 51:38.512
It will be just like what Gil-ju said,

51:39.638 --> 51:41.389
I'll eventually run wild like him.

51:46.228 --> 51:47.646
Once I turn to stone…

51:52.067 --> 51:53.735
will you bury me here like the others?

52:05.163 --> 52:09.334
He said something about the real Danju
and I found where the real Danju is now.

52:11.002 --> 52:14.047
The palace. They're in the palace.

52:18.510 --> 52:21.263
[Jin] Please tell me
what you know about the ice stone.

52:23.056 --> 52:24.307
Are you certain

52:24.391 --> 52:25.976
that the ice stone
known to have been destroyed

52:26.059 --> 52:28.103
by Master Seo Gyeong 200 years ago

52:29.563 --> 52:33.275
has truly been rid
from this world, Hemp Master Lee?

52:36.069 --> 52:37.487
Is it at all possible…

52:39.322 --> 52:40.699
it's still in Songrim?

53:01.887 --> 53:03.805
It is good to see you, Danju.

53:03.889 --> 53:05.891
[suspenseful music playing]

53:20.113 --> 53:21.656
Gil-ju was in search of the ice stone

53:21.740 --> 53:23.950
and went to the palace
to request an audience with me.

53:24.951 --> 53:26.077
I wasn't aware

53:27.078 --> 53:30.206
that Gil-ju knew the truth
about you being the real Danju.

53:30.290 --> 53:32.751
[queen] Soon comes the day
the Choi family regains power,

53:32.834 --> 53:36.755
and Songrim which caused
our family's downfall will be destroyed.

53:38.757 --> 53:41.968
And the entire kingdom
of Daeho will be under my control.

53:43.720 --> 53:45.972
I, too, have been waiting
for that day to come.

53:47.682 --> 53:51.144
We must find the person who followed
Gil-ju to the palace before killing him.

53:52.604 --> 53:55.065
He must have known that
Gil-ju was after the ice stone,

53:55.148 --> 53:57.901
and followed him to the palace,
hoping to find the stone.

53:57.984 --> 54:00.946
If that individual knows
that the ice stone is in the palace,

54:01.029 --> 54:02.489
you must go and find them,

54:03.573 --> 54:04.866
and then you must kill them.

54:09.454 --> 54:10.914
I don't know who it is,

54:11.915 --> 54:13.541
but he said
the real Danju is in the palace

54:13.625 --> 54:16.711
with the ice stone which could prevent
a soul shifter from ever running wild.

54:18.797 --> 54:22.050
Are you suggesting we break into
the palace and search for the Danju?

54:22.133 --> 54:24.135
It is impossible at my current level.

54:24.928 --> 54:27.931
I'm just a low-skilled mage
who was rejected by Jeongjingak.

54:28.014 --> 54:30.600
However, I'll keep improving.

54:31.726 --> 54:34.229
I'll keep climbing
until I reach the palace.

54:35.814 --> 54:36.731
Master.

54:38.108 --> 54:39.025
I will find…

54:40.402 --> 54:41.778
the ice stone for you.

54:47.283 --> 54:48.118
Jang Uk.

54:49.202 --> 54:51.538
I am not a master
who is strong enough to pull you up,

54:52.622 --> 54:55.291
and I'm not strong enough
to support you even from the bottom.

54:56.960 --> 55:00.005
It's not like you've ever really
encouraged me or supported me, either.

55:00.672 --> 55:02.257
You'd rather push me to my death.

55:03.174 --> 55:04.009
[scoffs]

55:05.760 --> 55:07.387
But as you pushed me and pushed me,

55:07.470 --> 55:10.306
I found I've reached a new level
I could never even imagine.

55:13.476 --> 55:15.311
So please, stay by my side,

55:15.895 --> 55:17.522
and keep pushing me that way.

55:27.490 --> 55:28.324
Fine.

55:29.659 --> 55:31.786
I will continue to stay by your side,

55:31.870 --> 55:34.205
but if you stop, I'll push you to death.

55:34.289 --> 55:36.332
[soft music playing]

55:36.416 --> 55:37.250
[scoffs]

55:39.836 --> 55:40.670
[chuckles softly]

55:45.675 --> 55:46.676
[sighs]

56:01.733 --> 56:04.819
I'll go find Uk and make sure
he doesn't come to the duel, just in case.

56:06.654 --> 56:07.822
There's no need.

56:08.490 --> 56:10.825
If he does intend
to show his face at the duel,

56:11.701 --> 56:12.660
do not stop him.

56:12.744 --> 56:15.413
This is a legitimate duel
between two mages.

56:16.164 --> 56:18.374
No one is allowed to intervene
if one of them were to die.

56:20.502 --> 56:22.253
If he ends up dying during the fight,

56:24.214 --> 56:25.715
then there's nothing we can do.

56:30.136 --> 56:31.679
So you won't stop it then?

56:35.642 --> 56:38.311
Uk's accepted the duel
on behalf of Songrim

56:38.394 --> 56:40.480
as it was agreed upon by the Assembly.

56:41.397 --> 56:43.316
Whether he runs away dishonorably,

56:44.025 --> 56:46.027
or honorably fights to his death,

56:46.903 --> 56:51.783
I will simply watch over
whatever happens as Songrim's leader.

56:52.784 --> 56:54.828
[tense music playing]

57:07.632 --> 57:09.634
[solemn music playing]

58:23.917 --> 58:28.004
[eunuch] Now presenting the king,
and queen of Daeho!

58:28.505 --> 58:30.673
[dramatic music playing]

59:01.287 --> 59:04.082
One month ago,
Go Won of the royal house Go

59:04.165 --> 59:06.793
had sent the eldest son
of the Jang family, Jang Uk,

59:06.876 --> 59:07.710
a challenge to a duel.

59:07.794 --> 59:11.548
And Songrim received
the challenge on Uk's behalf.

59:11.631 --> 59:14.175
Any mage who signs
the agreement to the duel

59:14.259 --> 59:16.427
is unable to hold
their opponent responsible

59:17.428 --> 59:20.473
for anything that could happen,
even if this duel ends in their death.

59:22.183 --> 59:26.563
The duel will commence
right at twelve o'clock.

59:26.646 --> 59:28.731
If he does not arrive by noon,

59:29.524 --> 59:31.526
it will be considered his defeat.

59:34.237 --> 59:37.407
You should mention
his punishment that he'll receive

59:37.490 --> 59:39.242
if he ends up forfeiting the duel.

59:42.537 --> 59:47.125
If Jang Uk forfeits the duel
to the Prince and does not appear,

59:47.917 --> 59:51.796
Jang Uk's right to become
the next Gwanju of Cheonbugwan…

59:53.923 --> 59:55.341
will be stripped.

59:57.760 --> 59:58.595
[gasps]

59:59.762 --> 01:00:01.973
[suspenseful music playing]

01:00:16.529 --> 01:00:17.363
[Jin Mu] Yeom-su.

01:00:19.115 --> 01:00:20.950
What are those over there for?

01:00:22.744 --> 01:00:24.412
[Yeom-su] They're just jars
filled with water.

01:00:24.996 --> 01:00:26.331
Filled with water?

01:00:31.294 --> 01:00:33.296
[percussive music playing]

01:00:59.238 --> 01:01:01.199
Excuse me, sir, it's now noon.

01:01:01.282 --> 01:01:03.242
Close the doors to the Training Center.

01:01:04.452 --> 01:01:05.495
I will announce…

01:01:06.871 --> 01:01:08.373
that Jang Uk has forfeited.

01:01:23.262 --> 01:01:25.264
[suspenseful music playing]

01:01:28.434 --> 01:01:29.352
Close the doors.

01:01:38.861 --> 01:01:40.863
[upbeat music playing]

01:01:43.491 --> 01:01:46.244
[Dang-gu stutters] Uh, Jang Uk--
Jang Uk's just entered!

01:01:55.002 --> 01:01:55.920
Young Master…

01:01:59.257 --> 01:02:01.259
[dramatic music playing]

01:02:12.562 --> 01:02:13.438
[scoffs]

01:02:13.521 --> 01:02:15.523
[suspenseful music playing]

01:02:26.617 --> 01:02:27.618
Young Master.

01:02:29.203 --> 01:02:30.204
I'll be fine for sure.

01:02:34.751 --> 01:02:37.086
JANG UK

01:02:37.170 --> 01:02:38.004
[gasps]

01:02:57.398 --> 01:02:59.358
Now that you've signed
the challenge contract,

01:02:59.442 --> 01:03:00.943
even if you die during the duel,

01:03:01.694 --> 01:03:03.571
no one may intervene.

01:03:04.906 --> 01:03:06.073
I am aware of that.

01:03:09.786 --> 01:03:10.995
Mother.

01:03:11.078 --> 01:03:14.332
Use our family's plaque
to put a stop to this duel.

01:03:14.415 --> 01:03:17.251
If he battles the Crown Prince,
Jang Uk is going to die.

01:03:17.335 --> 01:03:19.337
He showed up here
because he is ready to die.

01:03:19.420 --> 01:03:20.338
[breathes heavily]

01:03:20.421 --> 01:03:22.131
Your marriage no longer matters.

01:03:22.215 --> 01:03:24.884
Whether he dies or not,
it's no longer our concern.

01:03:25.384 --> 01:03:26.219
[exhales deeply]

01:03:38.481 --> 01:03:39.857
The duel may commence.

01:03:43.110 --> 01:03:45.071
[action music playing]

01:04:01.629 --> 01:04:03.714
[action music continues playing]

01:04:09.053 --> 01:04:11.264
[Mu-deok] At first, you must only defend.

01:04:11.347 --> 01:04:13.516
If you try to face him head-on
at your current skill level,

01:04:15.059 --> 01:04:16.227
you'll certainly die.

01:04:18.145 --> 01:04:20.064
You must wait and bide
your time for the moment

01:04:21.232 --> 01:04:22.817
he loses his concentration.

01:04:22.900 --> 01:04:25.069
[suspenseful music playing]

01:04:45.423 --> 01:04:46.799
[sword chimes]

01:05:00.855 --> 01:05:02.815
He should have placed them
where I asked him to.

01:05:02.899 --> 01:05:05.610
Master Lee, you went to Songrim
from time to time, right?

01:05:06.652 --> 01:05:07.612
Yes. And?

01:05:08.863 --> 01:05:10.406
I have a favor to ask you.

01:05:10.990 --> 01:05:13.618
Would you be able to put
some water in the Training Center

01:05:13.701 --> 01:05:14.994
so he can use Tansu in the duel?

01:05:25.338 --> 01:05:26.964
[swords clanging]

01:05:27.048 --> 01:05:28.215
[Jang Uk grunts]

01:05:29.175 --> 01:05:32.178
[Jin Mu] It is very suspicious
that those jars have been placed there.

01:05:33.888 --> 01:05:34.847
Go and break them.

01:05:42.521 --> 01:05:44.482
[suspenseful music playing]

01:06:15.638 --> 01:06:16.472
[grunts]

01:06:34.657 --> 01:06:35.700
Young Master.

01:06:37.368 --> 01:06:39.412
[thrilling music playing]

01:06:47.378 --> 01:06:48.504
Tansu?

01:06:55.845 --> 01:06:57.763
[loud chime]

01:07:03.561 --> 01:07:04.395
[gasps]

01:07:06.439 --> 01:07:07.398
Huh?

01:07:07.481 --> 01:07:08.357
[Jin] The match…

01:07:09.108 --> 01:07:10.276
has ended.

01:07:14.030 --> 01:07:15.239
[sighs in relief]

01:07:15.322 --> 01:07:17.658
You must have cheated. It's a sham.

01:07:27.501 --> 01:07:29.879
[Jin Mu] What he just performed was Tansu.

01:07:29.962 --> 01:07:32.923
A skill that only those
who have reached Chisu are able to do.

01:07:33.799 --> 01:07:37.053
How can someone
whose gate was just opened use Tansu?

01:07:37.636 --> 01:07:38.971
I have no doubt

01:07:39.055 --> 01:07:42.308
that a master among us has helped him.

01:07:42.391 --> 01:07:45.519
[Heo Yeom] Listen! All the mages
gathered today saw everything.

01:07:45.603 --> 01:07:47.438
How could anyone have helped him?

01:07:47.521 --> 01:07:48.981
Don't be so pig-headed!

01:07:49.607 --> 01:07:51.567
[Jin Mu] Jang Uk, why don't you tell us?

01:07:51.650 --> 01:07:54.195
Could you have really managed
to learn Tansu so quickly

01:07:54.278 --> 01:07:55.988
without first mastering Chisu?

01:07:57.531 --> 01:07:58.866
No, it's not like that.

01:07:59.784 --> 01:08:01.786
I still don't know how to gather energy,

01:08:01.869 --> 01:08:04.121
so I can only use Tansu
if I have water around, sir.

01:08:04.705 --> 01:08:07.416
I was only able to learn
how to flick water with it.

01:08:07.500 --> 01:08:09.794
But then who is your master
that taught you that?

01:08:11.587 --> 01:08:14.381
You must have a master
who taught you how to use that ability.

01:08:16.967 --> 01:08:18.010
I don't have one.

01:08:18.552 --> 01:08:19.386
[scoffs]

01:08:19.929 --> 01:08:20.971
Look at him.

01:08:21.680 --> 01:08:23.140
He's delusional
if he thinks that he can claim that

01:08:23.224 --> 01:08:25.684
he learned the technique without a master.

01:08:26.268 --> 01:08:27.103
[exhales]

01:08:28.854 --> 01:08:32.149
Earlier today, I spotted some water jars
that someone had placed for him.

01:08:33.150 --> 01:08:35.152
Who was willing to put them there for you?

01:08:36.987 --> 01:08:38.697
Could it be your master?

01:08:40.574 --> 01:08:42.034
I trained all on my own without masters.

01:08:42.118 --> 01:08:43.494
Tell me the truth right now!

01:08:43.577 --> 01:08:45.496
[Jin] Jang Uk, explain yourself.

01:08:48.916 --> 01:08:52.044
Who's been helping you learn
how to cast spells all this time?

01:08:52.128 --> 01:08:54.130
[tense music playing]

01:09:02.179 --> 01:09:03.264
[Master Lee] I did.

01:09:15.901 --> 01:09:17.486
I'm the one who was with him.

01:09:18.279 --> 01:09:21.448
Everything Jang Uk just said
is the absolute truth.

01:09:25.119 --> 01:09:26.287
And who are you?

01:09:27.204 --> 01:09:29.123
How dare you try to intervene?

01:09:29.206 --> 01:09:30.291
Shut your mouth!

01:09:31.000 --> 01:09:33.752
That man is the former pupil
of Master Seo Gyeong,

01:09:33.836 --> 01:09:35.504
the Great Master Lee Cheol!

01:09:35.588 --> 01:09:37.965
All of you, show some respect!

01:09:40.801 --> 01:09:42.636
Oh, uh… Master.

01:09:45.472 --> 01:09:48.893
I witnessed everything while
he was living with me in Danhyanggok.

01:09:48.976 --> 01:09:51.687
Every day, he's practiced
flicking water droplets with his sword.

01:09:54.899 --> 01:09:56.442
And the only one at his side…

01:09:57.943 --> 01:10:00.070
was no one other than his young servant.

01:10:02.364 --> 01:10:05.409
[Jin] Master Lee has vouched for Jang Uk.

01:10:07.620 --> 01:10:11.916
Do you have any further objections?

01:10:18.380 --> 01:10:20.090
[mages applauding]

01:10:22.218 --> 01:10:23.844
- [indistinct chattering]
- [mage] Incredible!

01:10:33.562 --> 01:10:34.563
- [sighs in relief]
- [huffs]

01:10:36.065 --> 01:10:36.941
[sighs]

01:10:37.024 --> 01:10:38.984
[soft music playing]

01:10:46.909 --> 01:10:48.494
Let us go, Your Majesty.

01:10:56.085 --> 01:10:57.419
[mage] I knew he can do it.

01:11:05.594 --> 01:11:08.347
Bring Jang Uk into Cheonbugwan somehow.

01:11:09.765 --> 01:11:11.767
[ominous music playing]

01:11:18.357 --> 01:11:19.191
[laughs softly]

01:11:20.943 --> 01:11:24.905
The only son of the Gwanju
Jang Gang is truly incredible.

01:11:24.989 --> 01:11:26.323
And since you have no master,

01:11:26.407 --> 01:11:30.035
Cheonbugwan will be
more than happy to take you in.

01:11:30.828 --> 01:11:32.705
[Heo Yeom] What kind of nonsense
are you saying?

01:11:32.788 --> 01:11:35.124
If you really think about it,
I should be his master.

01:11:35.207 --> 01:11:38.335
After all, I'm the one who opened
his gate and gave him my energy.

01:11:38.419 --> 01:11:40.838
Uk, come to Sejukwon.

01:11:40.921 --> 01:11:43.215
I promise
I will teach you everything, huh?

01:11:43.299 --> 01:11:45.551
[Ho-gyeong] How about coming to Jinyowon?

01:11:47.303 --> 01:11:49.138
Since you and Cho-yeon were once engaged,

01:11:49.221 --> 01:11:52.474
we will consider you as family
and teach you our own techniques.

01:11:56.937 --> 01:11:57.896
Jang Uk.

01:11:59.023 --> 01:12:01.275
If you wish to still join Jeongjingak…

01:12:02.985 --> 01:12:04.069
we'll accept you.

01:12:05.487 --> 01:12:07.489
[suspenseful music playing]

01:12:23.464 --> 01:12:24.590
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok.

01:12:24.673 --> 01:12:28.427
They're all asking me to go join them.
Where should I go now?

01:12:28.510 --> 01:12:30.429
[suspenseful music continues playing]

01:12:40.898 --> 01:12:42.691
You should join Songrim
for the time being,

01:12:43.567 --> 01:12:44.693
Young Master.

01:12:54.703 --> 01:12:56.789
I, Jang Uk of the Jang family,

01:12:57.581 --> 01:12:59.458
choose to join Songrim's Jeongjingak.

01:13:03.128 --> 01:13:06.131
[closing theme music playing]

01:13:56.682 --> 01:13:59.810
Young Master has become
a mage of Jeongjingak.

01:13:59.893 --> 01:14:01.562
There will be a welcome party

01:14:01.645 --> 01:14:03.689
- for our new fellow mage, Jang Uk.
- [mages cheer, applaud]

01:14:03.772 --> 01:14:05.941
I hate your master so much.
It is gut-wrenching.

01:14:06.024 --> 01:14:06.942
Oh, of course you do.

01:14:07.025 --> 01:14:08.819
[yelling]

01:14:09.695 --> 01:14:11.947
If they look elsewhere, then let them.

01:14:12.030 --> 01:14:12.990
Please let me in.

01:14:13.073 --> 01:14:13.907
Mu-deok.

01:14:13.991 --> 01:14:16.326
[Mu-deok] I will not be separated
from my Young Master.

01:14:16.410 --> 01:14:17.536
For now, go home and wait.

01:14:17.619 --> 01:14:19.955
[male servant] Young Master Jang snuck out
and has come home.

01:14:20.038 --> 01:14:22.583
Look! Young Master! Just wait there.

01:14:22.666 --> 01:14:24.835
- [Mu-deok] I'll be there soon, too.
- I found the exam papers.

01:14:25.502 --> 01:14:27.337
[Mu-deok] Please tell Young Master Jang,

01:14:27.421 --> 01:14:30.549
no matter what happens,
I will come to find him in Songrim.

01:14:30.632 --> 01:14:33.635
[Jang Uk] I need to find Mu-deok.
I'll fight harder.

01:14:33.719 --> 01:14:35.220
[chuckles softly]
